<title>USA: Congoleum Corp Q4 net rises to $0.39/shr.</title>
<headline>Congoleum Corp Q4 net rises to $0.39/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MERCERVILLE, N.J. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(IN THOUSANDS, EXCEPT PER SHARE AMOUNTS)</p>
<p>				    For the Three     For the Twelve</p>
<p>				     Months Ended	Months Ended</p>
<p>					 Dec. 31,	    Dec. 31,</p>
<p>				     1996	1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		    $ 69,053 $ 66,410 $269,451 $263,147</p>
<p> Net income			3,899    1,350   12,097    9,435</p>
<p>Primary earnings per</p>
<p>  common share		     .39	.14     1.21	.94</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of common and equivalent</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	  10,008   10,000   10,001   10,000</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 includes a charge of $1.5 million, or $0.15 a share, related to writeoff of accounts receivable from Color Tile Inc, which filed for Chapter 11 in January 1996.</p>
<p>Congoleum is a 44 percent owned subsidiary of American Biltrite Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
